            "text": "The SQL query has been validated and appears to be syntactically correct for BigQuery against the OMOP v5.4 schema.\n\nHere is the BigQuery SQL query based on your specifications:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    dc.concept_id,\n    dc.concept_name,\n    dc.domain_id,\n    dc.vocabulary_id\nFROM\n    concept_relationship AS cr\nJOIN\n    concept AS c1\n    ON cr.concept_id_1 = c1.concept_id\nJOIN\n    concept AS c2\n    ON cr.concept_id_2 = c2.concept_id\nJOIN\n    concept_ancestor AS ca\n    ON ca.ancestor_concept_id = c2.concept_id\nJOIN\n    concept AS dc\n    ON ca.descendant_concept_id = dc.concept_id\nWHERE\n    cr.relationship_id = 'Maps to'\n    AND c1.concept_code = '410.0'\n    AND c1.vocabulary_id = 'ICD9CM'\n    AND cr.invalid_reason IS NULL\n    AND dc.standard_concept = 'S';\n```"
